<title>USA: U.S. Electricar to buy Systronix.</title>
<headline>U.S. Electricar to buy Systronix.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Electricar Inc said it reached an agreement to buy all the assets and certain liabilities of Systronix Corp, a development-stage company working on advanced propulsion systmes for electric vehicles.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction, which is expected to close on or before October 15, were not disclosed.</p>
